<title>SINGAPORE: Vietnam raises term price of Bach Ho crude - sources.</title>
<headline>Vietnam raises term price of Bach Ho crude - sources.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Petro Vietnam Trading Co (Petechim) and Bach Ho crude buyers have agreed a term-lifting price of APPI Minas +80 cents per barrel for the April to September period, trading sources said on Monday.</p>
</text>
